  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">냄비에 국수를 삶으면<br>거품 때문에 국물이 넘치는데요.<br>&#160;<br>국물이 넘치지 않는 방법은?<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>어남 선생은<br>냄비가 아닌, 후라이팬을 사용합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7f0e7f6aa6d3c53450d3390bf71df8439952c91\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7f0e7f6aa6d3c53450d3390bf71df8439952c91\" data-origin-width=\"1143\" data-origin-height=\"679\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J6ZZKKNYGUE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J6ZZKKNYGUE</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J6ZZKKNYGUE\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"500\" data-video-height=\"281\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/0zZCy/hyZPMmswlE/MkwCCP8QRLWreIpANTTjUK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/EKiai/hyZPn9rQAw/meMkystpRjpeUzcFR3ajo0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/IquaG/hyZPu8z8l4/oztK0PMz9VpwUoPA81Twg1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/J6ZZKKNYGUE\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">(나의 과학탐구)<br>냄비가 아닌,<br>후라이팬에 국수를 삶으면 왜 국물이 넘치지 않을까요?<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
